          "type": "Text",
          "markdown": "# Mission Control\n\nTop row = needs attention (anything not green is a to-do). Second block = every pipeline's age as a % of its schedule budget: 100% means the latest run that should have finished has not landed. Bottom = headline numbers.\n\n**Overview** \u00b7 [Bot Ops](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_BOT_OPS>) \u00b7 [Trading](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_TRADING>) \u00b7 [Golf](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_GOLF>) \u00b7 [Birds](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_BIRDS>) \u00b7 [Home](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_HOME>) \u00b7 [Ops](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_OPS>)\n\nColors: green = fine, gold = watch (75% of budget used), red = act now. Tile titles say what to do."
